  "excerpt": "Cá kho tộ is Vietnamese fish braised in a dark, sticky caramel of fish sauce, sugar, and coconut water. The fish becomes intensely flavoured and almost melts into the sweet-savoury sauce. This recipe serves 4 alongside steamed rice.",
